<title>USA: MicroEnergy Inc Q4 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>MicroEnergy Inc Q4 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CAROL STREAM, Ill. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended June 30</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.47   profit	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net loss		     889   profit	   104</p>
<p> Revs			 3,668		    3,592</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 360,088		  316,768</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.98   profit	 $0.79</p>
<p> Net profit		   352   profit	   250</p>
<p> Revs			14,386		   14,489</p>
<p>  Avg shrs		 360,088		  316,768</p>
<p>(All data above 000s)</p>
<p>NOTE - Company said operating expenses rose about $600,000 as a result of decision to expand its infrastructure and related resources to handle higher growth expected in fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
